🎯 Goal

For every problem:

Understand the problem first.
Try it yourself for 20–30 minutes.
Think about brute force first.
Then try to optimize.
Write the solution in Java.
Identify time and space complexity.
If you see the solution, close it and implement it again yourself.

Target: Don't focus on solving 66 problems quickly. Focus on being able to recognize the pattern and explain your solution.